{"code":401,"indent":2,"parameters":["惠仁叹了口气一脸拿你没辙的表情看着你。啊，今天似乎是惠仁的"]},{"code":401,"indent":2,"parameters":["“享受阳光日”而并非“青春期少女的心思日”呢？"]},{"code":232,"indent":2,"parameters":[5,0,0,0,158,0,50,50,0,0,60,true,0]},{"code":235,"indent":2,"parameters":[5]},{"code":221,"indent":2,"parameters":[]},{"code":201,"indent":2,"parameters":[0,13,0,0,0,0]},{"code":211,"indent":2,"parameters":[0]},{"code":0,"indent":2,"parameters":[]},{"code":404,"indent":1,"parameters":[]},{"code":242,"indent":1,"parameters":[3]},{"code":0,"indent":1,"parameters":[]},{"code":402,"indent":0,"parameters":[1,"还没选好..."]},{"code":101,"indent":1,"parameters":["",0,0,2,"李惠仁"]},{"code":401,"indent":1,"parameters":["把所有地方都看一遍再决定吧！"]},{"code":0,"indent":1,"parameters":[]},{"code":404,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":232,"indent":0,"parameters":[9,0,0,0,158,0,50,50,0,0,60,true,0]},{"code":235,"indent":0,"parameters":[9]},{"code":0,"indent":0,"parameters":[]}],"moveFrequency":2,"moveRoute":{"list":[{"code":0,"parameters":[]}],"repeat":true,"skippable":false,"wait":false},"moveSpeed":3,"moveType":0,"priorityType":1,"stepAnime":false,"through":false,"trigger":0,"walkAnime":true}],"x":0,"y":3},
{"id":3,"name":"学生1、2、3","note":"","pages":[{"conditions":{"actorId":1,"actorValid":false,"itemId":1,"itemValid":false,"selfSwitchCh":"A","selfSwitchValid":false,"switch1Id":1,"switch1Valid":false,"switch2Id":1,"switch2Valid":false,"variableId":1,"variableValid":false,"variableValue":0},"directionFix":false,"image":{"tileId":706,"characterName":"","characterIndex":0,"direction":2,"pattern":0},"list":[{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,"忙着说话的学生"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["小佳妈妈的糖醋排骨！好久没吃到了好想念。"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,"忙着吃饭的学生"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["我也想做小佳妈妈的女儿……我家那两位天天带我去外面吃，我们家"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["的家庭食谱一年四季只有方便面。"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,"有些不好意思的学生"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["你们俩也太夸张了吧！而且去外面吃挺好的，我倒是羡慕你呢，除了"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["放学能偷偷跟你们俩吃点路边小摊，我很少能吃到外头卖的东西。"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,"忙着说话的学生"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["各家的家风不一样嘛…说起来总是蹭小佳你的午餐，你妈妈都要做成"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["三人份带过来了，真不好意思…"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,"忙着说话的学生"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["下次我们去你家的时候会给阿姨带些礼物的！"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,"有些不好意思的学生"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["谢谢！那我妈妈会很开心的！来！快趁热吃吧！"]},{"code":123,"indent":0,"parameters":["A",0]},{"code":121,"indent":0,"parameters":[18,18,0]},{"code":0,"indent":0,"parameters":[]}],"moveFrequency":3,"moveRoute":{"list":[{"code":0,"parameters":[]}],"repeat":true,"skippable":false,"wait":false},"moveSpeed":3,"moveType":0,"priorityType":1,"stepAnime":false,"through":false,"trigger":0,"walkAnime":true},{"conditions":{"actorId":1,"actorValid":false,"itemId":1,"itemValid":false,"selfSwitchCh":"A","selfSwitchValid":true,"switch1Id":1,"switch1Valid":false,"switch2Id":1,"switch2Valid":false,"variableId":1,"variableValid":false,"variableValue":0},"directionFix":false,"image":{"tileId":706,"characterName":"","characterIndex":0,"direction":2,"pattern":0},"list":[{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["三个女生在阳光下悠闲地享受着午餐，并对“小佳妈妈做的排骨”"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["赞不绝口。"]},{"code":0,"indent":0,"parameters":[]}],"moveFrequency":3,"moveRoute":{"list":[{"code":0,"parameters":[]}],"repeat":true,"skippable":false,"wait":false},"moveSpeed":3,"moveType":0,"priorityType":1,"stepAnime":false,"through":false,"trigger":0,"walkAnime":true}],"x":10,"y":8},
{"id":4,"name":"自动贩卖机","note":"","pages":[{"conditions":{"actorId":1,"actorValid":false,"itemId":1,"itemValid":false,"selfSwitchCh":"A","selfSwitchValid":false,"switch1Id":1,"switch1Valid":false,"switch2Id":1,"switch2Valid":false,"variableId":1,"variableValid":false,"variableValue":0},"directionFix":false,"image":{"tileId":656,"characterName":"","characterIndex":0,"direction":2,"pattern":0},"list":[{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["自动贩卖机前不知为何围了一些人，最前端的一个学生在吵嚷着"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["什么。"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,"围在一起的学生们"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["路过的学生也三三两两地聚了过来，好奇地向内层探头：“怎么了"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["怎么了？”"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,"围在一起的学生们"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["在内围的学生闻声回头，热心地解释道：“老铁又出BUG了！”"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["老铁，是自动贩卖机的名字。贩卖机的玻璃窗上被不知是哪一届的"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["学生用胶条封着贴了张纸条，上面用艺术字体写了“老铁”两字。"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["即使被胶条封了层，经过长久的风吹日晒和雨水冲刷，最原汁原味的"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["“老铁”两字已经浅得只剩褪色的模糊色块了，新的“老铁”们是被"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["后来的学生画了纹样重新贴上去的。"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,"围在一起的学生们"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["我刚才塞了500圆的硬币，结果老铁只找了我300圆，你猜剩下那"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["100圆是什么？它找了我一枚瓶盖儿！我就想喝瓶可乐而已！"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,"围在一起的学生们"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["老铁是不是真的年纪大了不中用了…我们找老师反馈一下吧？"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,"围在一起的学生们"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["是啊！这个月已经是第三次出毛病了！上次它连着吞了我两个一元"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["钢镚！"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,"围在一起的学生们"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["老铁的冰镇功能也不太管用了。它这位置还被太阳直晒着，上次给我"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["吐了瓶热凉茶出来…"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["学生们开始冲着老铁游行抗议了……"]},{"code":123,"indent":0,"parameters":["B",0]},{"code":121,"indent":0,"parameters":[19,19,0]},{"code":0,"indent":0,"parameters":[]}],"moveFrequency":3,"moveRoute":{"list":[{"code":0,"parameters":[]}],"repeat":true,"skippable":false,"wait":false},"moveSpeed":3,"moveType":0,"priorityType":1,"stepAnime":false,"through":false,"trigger":0,"walkAnime":true},{"conditions":{"actorId":1,"actorValid":false,"itemId":1,"itemValid":false,"selfSwitchCh":"B","selfSwitchValid":true,"switch1Id":1,"switch1Valid":false,"switch2Id":1,"switch2Valid":false,"variableId":1,"variableValid":false,"variableValue":0},"directionFix":false,"image":{"tileId":656,"characterName":"","characterIndex":0,"direction":2,"pattern":0},"list":[{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,0,2,""]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["对着机器抗议可能没什么用，大家，是不是趁着午休去找老师比较好"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["......？"]},{"code":0,"indent":0,"parameters":[]}],"moveFrequency":3,"moveRoute":{"list":[{"code":0,"parameters":[]}],"repeat":true,"skippable":false,"wait":false},"moveSpeed":3,"moveType":0,"priorityType":1,"stepAnime":false,"through":false,"trigger":0,"walkAnime":true}],"x":8,"y":2},
